{"id":"2ad624e4e75f394b","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-commutant.md","title":"Commutant","display":"df-commutant — Commutant","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-commutant","aliases":["58-df-commutant","Commutant"],"display":"df-commutant — Commutant","depends_on":["[[58-df-hilbert-space]]","[[58-df-bounded-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-commutant"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-commutant</span><span>Commutant</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-commutant — Commutant"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"58-df-hilbert-space\">58-df-hilbert-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"58-df-bounded-operator\">58-df-bounded-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CommutantStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\">\\(\\mathrm{CommutantStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Commutant}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{Commutant}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\cup V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\cup V^{2}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H},\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H},\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"58-df-hilbert-space\">58-df-hilbert-space</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\\)</span> (structure-explicit bounded-operator predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"58-df-bounded-operator\">58-df-bounded-operator</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_B(x)=\\sqrt{B(x,x)}\">\\(\\nu_B(x)=\\sqrt{B(x,x)}\\)</span> is the norm induced by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CommutantStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{CommutantStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (structure-explicit predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Commutant}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Commutant}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (commutant predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}commutant\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CommutantStructure}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal M\\subseteq\\Bigl\\{R\\in\\mathcal H^{\\mathcal H}:\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\n(R;\\mathcal H,\\nu_B,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H};\n\\mathcal H,\\nu_B,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H};k)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal N=\\Bigl\\{T\\in\\mathcal H^{\\mathcal H}:\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\n(T;\\mathcal H,\\nu_B,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H};\n\\mathcal H,\\nu_B,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H};k)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{130pt}\\land\\forall S\\in\\mathcal M\\;(T\\circ S=S\\circ T)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}commutant\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CommutantStructure}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal M\\subseteq\\Bigl\\{R\\in\\mathcal H^{\\mathcal H}:\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\n(R;\\mathcal H,\\nu_B,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H};\n\\mathcal H,\\nu_B,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H};k)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal N=\\Bigl\\{T\\in\\mathcal H^{\\mathcal H}:\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\n(T;\\mathcal H,\\nu_B,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H};\n\\mathcal H,\\nu_B,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H};k)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{130pt}\\land\\forall S\\in\\mathcal M\\;(T\\circ S=S\\circ T)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}commutant}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Commutant}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H}\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{CommutantStructure}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}commutant}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Commutant}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H}\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{CommutantStructure}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Commutant: all operators commuting with the supplied set.  The explicit core now fixes one Hilbert structure and its induced norm for every operator; different existential operator structures can no longer be chosen independently.</li>\n<li>The bicommutant theorem applies to a unital self-adjoint operator algebra, not to an arbitrary subset <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A von Neumann algebra is a unital *-subalgebra of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathcal H)\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathcal H)\\)</span> equal to its bicommutant.</li>\n<li>If the operators in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> commute pairwise, then <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\subseteq\\mathcal M&#39;\">\\(\\mathcal M\\subseteq\\mathcal M&#39;\\)</span>; in general <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M&#39;\">\\(\\mathcal M&#39;\\)</span> need not equal all of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathcal H)\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathcal H)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kadison and Ringrose, Operator Algebras</li>\n<li>Conway, A Course in Operator Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-hilbert-space","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-hilbert-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bounded-operator","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bounded-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hilbert-space","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})$ (see [[58-df-hilbert-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bounded-operator","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S$ (structure-explicit bounded-operator predicate, see [[58-df-bounded-operator]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{10}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CommutantStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{7}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Commutant}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\cup V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H},\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu_B(x)=\\sqrt{B(x,x)}","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CommutantStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Commutant}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}commutant\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CommutantStructure}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H})\\\\\n&\\land\\mathcal M\\subseteq\\Bigl\\{R\\in\\mathcal H^{\\mathcal H}:\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\n(R;\\mathcal H,\\nu_B,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H};\n\\mathcal H,\\nu_B,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H};k)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\mathcal N=\\Bigl\\{T\\in\\mathcal H^{\\mathcal H}:\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\n(T;\\mathcal H,\\nu_B,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H};\n\\mathcal H,\\nu_B,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H};k)\\\\\n&\\hspace{130pt}\\land\\forall S\\in\\mathcal M\\;(T\\circ S=S\\circ T)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}commutant}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Commutant}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H}\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{CommutantStructure}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H,B,k,+_{\\mathcal H},\\odot_{\\mathcal H}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(\\mathcal H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M\\subseteq\\mathcal M'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(\\mathcal H)","display":false}],"bytes":2840,"backlinks":[{"id":"9ec14d57629b7a4c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2191f28be68a0b41","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4329390cb4b96060","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Commutant}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal H)$ means that $\\mathcal N$ is the commutant of $\\mathcal A$ on $\\mathcal H$ (see [[58-df-commutant]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-316","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-commutant.md|58-df-commutant]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["b70ce791d5b1a19b","2ad9c248fe18df37"]}